URL=https://penelope.uchicago.edu/Thayer/E/Roman/Texts/Suetonius/12Caesars/Tiberius*.html#note30:~:text=Since%20the%20consuls%20caused%20a%20law%20to%20be%20passed%20soon%20after%20this%20that%20he%20should%20govern%20the%20provinces%20jointly%20with%20Augustus%20and%20hold%20the%20census%20with%20him%2C%20he%20set%20out%20for%20Illyricum%20on%20the%20conclusion%20of%20the%20lustral%20ceremonies
